  "scope": "state:ga",
  "title": "HB 397 (2025-2026 Regular Session (2025 votes)): Elections; allow municipalities to opt in to providing advance voting on Saturdays for municipal elections",
  "urls": [
    "https://www.legis.ga.gov/legislation/ (detail and vote pages answer 401 without the site token; not used)",
    "https://www.legis.ga.gov/api/document/docs/default-source/senate-journal-document-library/2025-senate-journal.pdf (Senate Journal 2025, pp. 2953-2966, 2 Apr 2025)",
